    <visualElement>
      <elementName>Text</elementName>
      <elementAttributes>
        <entry>
          <string>textFontSize</string>
          <int>10</int>
        </entry>
        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>Note: In the debug module I have
something set up to override
this clock to maximum when debug
work needs to be done.
It&apos;s definitely a hack but worth it
for the debugging performance.
TLDR: The clock speed that you set 
here really just dictates how 
fast it will go *most* of the time.
(Unless you disable that feature.)</string>
        </entry>
